- [ ] Use `dfhack.units.getPosition()` for reliable unit coordinates.
- [ ] Use `dfhack.gui.revealInDwarfmodeMap(pos, true, true)` for map focus.
- [ ] Handle missing, caged, invalid, or off-map positions gracefully.

## Phase 6: Validation and Polish
